The '''Robgoblin Camp''' is an settlement area home to many [[Robgoblins|robgoblins]] that is located northwest of [[Lakeshore]]. It is where the famous [[Wizard|wizard]], [[Fizzlesticks]], and a masterful [[Chef|chef]], Glerga, have made their homes. The robgoblins in this camp are known for swindling items from nearby towns, and are usually kept under a close watch, especially by the village of Lakeshore.

Visitors to the camp are welcomed to entertain themselves with a game of checkers or chess, or utilize the cooking table to create various recipes. The robgoblins are fans of putting on shows, with a stage act constantly going on for passing travelers and locals alike to stop and enjoy.

While robgoblins are not known for their pleasure of sharing their treasures with outsiders, a few [[Merchants|merchants]] here do offer some goods for a price.
